+Set a bot's optional **Webhook URL** to receive a JSON callback whenever someone
+mentions it. The webhook is delivered in a background job. A `200` response with
+a `text/plain` or `text/html` content type is posted as the bot; a `204` response
+posts nothing. Bots can also use the `reply_to` URL in the callback to post later.
